{
    "_readme": [
        "BTW cross-vector contract — ONE input set, TWO consumers:",
        "  backend/tests/Unit/BtwCrossVectorTest.php   (BtwCalculationService, bcmath)",
        "  frontend/src/store/__tests__/btwCrossVectors.test.ts (cart engine, fixed-point)",
        "Expected values are GENERATED from the bcmath engine by",
        "  backend/scripts/generate-btw-vectors.php  (run inside the app container)",
        "and then FROZEN — regenerating is a deliberate contract change and must be",
        "reviewed line by line against the Belastingdienst rules (discount before",
        "BTW extraction, tax-inclusive prices, half-up rounding to the cent).",
        "Rules frozen by this file:",
        "  - money is decimal; intermediates at scale 4 with TRUNCATING mul/div",
        "  - final figures round HALF-UP to 2 decimals (never binary-float rounding)",
        "  - item pct discount converts to SRD as round2(line_gross * pct / 100)",
        "    BEFORE entering the engine (this is what the POS sends on the wire)",
        "  - sale pct discount stays a pct on the wire; engine takes trunc4(subtotal*pct/100)",
        "  - sale SRD + pct combine additively (scope 'php': the POS UI offers one at a time)",
        "  - sale-level exemption strips per-UNIT price to round2(price / (1+rate/100))",
        "scope: 'both' = both engines must reproduce; 'php' = backend-only shapes"
    ],
